<gpx xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1" version="1.1" creator="Venice by Building church route"><metadata><name>Churches, temples and monasteries of Venice</name><desc>INVENTORY INCOMPLETE: 7 unresolved identities. Exterior waypoints, not verified entrances. Only tracks follow the OSM pedestrian network. SCHEMATIC routes are NOT NAVIGATION and assert no length or boat service.</desc></metadata><wpt lon="12.32221" lat="45.44128"><name>001 Santa Maria degli Scalzi</name><desc>Exterior reference only. Opening, worship, entrance and step-free access must be checked locally.</desc><link href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiesa_di_Santa_Maria_di_Nazareth_(Venezia)" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.325453" lat="45.442756"><name>002 San Geremia</name><desc>Exterior reference only. Opening, worship, entrance and step-free access must be checked locally.</desc><link href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiesa_di_San_Geremia" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.326715" lat="45.443417"><name>003 San Leonardo</name><desc>Exterior reference only. Opening, worship, entrance and step-free access must be checked locally.</desc><link href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiesa_di_San_Leonardo_(Venezia)" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.325563" lat="45.444618"><name>004 Spanish Synagogue</name><desc>Exterior reference only. Opening, worship, entrance and step-free access must be checked locally.</desc><link href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scola_Ponentina" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.32555556" lat="45.44472222"><name>005 Scola Levantina</name><desc>Exterior reference only. Opening, worship, entrance and step-free access must be checked locally.</desc><link href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Levantine_Synagogue" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.326621" lat="45.445149"><name>006 Italian Synagogue</name><desc>Exterior reference only. Opening, worship, entrance and step-free access must be checked locally.</desc><link href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scola_Italiana" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.326835" lat="45.445029"><name>007 Canton Syna