nly. Opening, worship, entrance and step-free access must be checked locally. Convento di Santa Caterina: surviving convent converted to Liceo Marco Foscarini</desc><link href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiesa_di_Santa_Caterina_(Venezia)" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.335164" lat="45.443875"><name>029 Abbazia della Misericordia</name><desc>Exterior reference only. Opening, worship, entrance and step-free access must be checked locally.</desc><link href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiesa_dell'Abbazia_della_Misericordia" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.32041" lat="45.44497"><name>030 San Giobbe</name><desc>Exterior reference only. Opening, worship, entrance and step-free access must be checked locally.</desc><link href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiesa_di_San_Giobbe" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.3189" lat="45.4469"><name>031 Santa Maria delle Penitenti</name><desc>Exterior reference only. Opening, worship, entrance and step-free access must be checked locally.</desc><link href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiesa_di_Santa_Maria_delle_Penitenti" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.3172579" lat="45.4403385"><name>032 Convento di Santa Chiara / Questura</name><desc>Restricted/private premises; exterior only, no public admission asserted. Convento di Santa Chiara / Questura: article explicitly says only the convent survives, police headquarters since 1960</desc><link href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiesa_di_Santa_Chiara_(Venezia%2C_Santa_Croce)" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.316733" lat="45.439096"><name>033 Nome di Gesù</name><desc>Exterior reference only. Opening, worship, entrance and step-free access must be checked locally. Monastero del Nome di Gesù: surviving house behind church formerly occupied by Clarisse</desc><link href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiesa_del_Nome_di_Ges%C3%B9" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.316111" lat="45.438333"><name>034 Sant’Andrea della Zirada</name><desc>Exterior reference only. Opening, worship, entrance and step-free access must be checked locally.</desc><link href="https://it