wiki/Chiesa_dei_Santi_Filippo_e_Giacomo_(Venezia)" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.343333" lat="45.434722"><name>099 San Zaccaria</name><desc>Exterior reference only. Opening, worship, entrance and step-free access must be checked locally.</desc><link href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiesa_di_San_Zaccaria" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.344941" lat="45.434202"><name>100 Santa Maria della Pietà</name><desc>Exterior reference only. Opening, worship, entrance and step-free access must be checked locally.</desc><link href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiesa_della_Piet%C3%A0_(Venezia)" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.345711" lat="45.4342948"><name>101 Convento del Santo Sepolcro / Caserma Cornoldi</name><desc>Restricted/private premises; exterior only, no public admission asserted. Convento del Santo Sepolcro / Caserma Cornoldi: surviving adapted convent and partial north cloister; church demolished</desc><link href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Convento_del_Santo_Sepolcro" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.346959" lat="45.434298"><name>102 San Giovanni in Bragora</name><desc>Exterior reference only. Opening, worship, entrance and step-free access must be checked locally.</desc><link href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiesa_di_San_Giovanni_in_Bragora" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.346667" lat="45.435556"><name>103 Sant'Antonin</name><desc>Exterior reference only. Opening, worship, entrance and step-free access must be checked locally.</desc><link href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiesa_di_Sant'Antonin" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.345977" lat="45.436263"><name>104 Scuola di San Giorgio degli Schiavoni</name><desc>Exterior reference only. Opening, worship, entrance and step-free access must be checked locally.</desc><link href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scuola_di_San_Giorgio_degli_Schiavoni" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.346194" lat="45.436425"><name>105 San Giovanni di Malta</name><desc>Exterior reference only. Opening, worship, entrance and step-free access must be checked locally.</desc><link href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiesa_di_San_Giovanni_di_Malta_(Venezia)" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.3455375" lat="45.4372706"><name>106 San Lorenzo e chiostro del monastero</name><desc>Exterior reference; opening and access require local verification. San Lorenzo e chiostro del monastero: church survives with ancient convent cloister; demolition assertions refer to San Sebastiano chapel and one convent wing</desc><link href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiesa_di_San_Lorenzo_(Venezia)" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.346078" lat="45.43812"><name>107 Ex chiesa di Santa Giustina</name><desc>Exterior reference only. Opening, worship, entrance and step-free access must be checked locally.</desc><link href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiesa_di_Santa_Giustina_(Venezia)" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.348472" lat="45.438"><name>108 oratorio di san Marco in Vinea</name><desc>Exterior reference only. Opening, worship, entrance and step-free access must be checked locally.</desc><link href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiese_di_Venezia" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.348638" lat="45.438153"><name>109 San Francesco della Vigna</name><desc>Exterior reference only. Opening, worship, entrance and step-free access must be checked locally. Convento di San Francesco della Vigna: surviving Franciscan convent and cloisters</desc><link href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiesa_di_San_Francesco_della_Vigna" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.3493237" lat="45.4380991"><name>110 oratorio di Cristo Re</name><desc>Exterior reference only. Opening, worship, entrance and step-free access must be checked locally.</desc><link href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiese_di_Venezia" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.3498" lat="45.4375"><name>111 Chiostro del convento della Celestia</name><desc>Exterior reference; opening and access require local verification. Chiostro del convento della Celestia: article explicitly identifies surviving convent cloister of 1571, not demolished church</desc><link href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiesa_di_Santa_Maria_della_Celestia" /></wpt><