wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiesa_di_San_Giuseppe_di_Castello" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.3596" lat="45.43458"><name>119 San Pietro di Castello</name><desc>Exterior reference only. Opening, worship, entrance and step-free access must be checked locally.</desc><link href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Basilica_di_San_Pietro_di_Castello" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.365644" lat="45.427331"><name>120 Sant'Elena</name><desc>Exterior reference only. Opening, worship, entrance and step-free access must be checked locally. Convento di Sant’Elena: surviving fifteenth-century cloister wings plus later convent</desc><link href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiesa_di_Sant'Elena_(Venezia)" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.34483" lat="45.43543"><name>121 San Giorgio dei Greci</name><desc>Exterior reference only. Opening, worship, entrance and step-free access must be checked locally.</desc><link href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiesa_di_San_Giorgio_dei_Greci" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.343427" lat="45.438075"><name>122 Ex convento di San Giovanni Laterano</name><desc>Exterior reference; opening and access require local verification. Ex convento di San Giovanni Laterano: former monastery reused as notarial archive and school; only oratory explicitly completely demolished</desc><link href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiesa_di_San_Giovanni_Laterano" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.3428" lat="45.43878"><name>123 Chiesa dell'Ospedaletto</name><desc>Exterior reference only. Opening, worship, entrance and step-free access must be checked locally.</desc><link href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiesa_dell'Ospedaletto" /></wpt><wpt lon="12.3422" lat="45.4393"><name>124 Santi Giovanni e Paolo</name><desc>Exterior reference only. Opening, worship, entrance and step-free access must be checked locally. Convento dei Santi Giovanni e Paolo: two surviving cloisters; former convent hospital and current convent in Scuola di Sant’Orsola</desc><link href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Basilica_dei_Santi_Giovanni_e_Paolo_(Venezia)" /></wpt